#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:5
#: d188b296398b44b9bf6bcc2f2542aea4
msgid "Yaapu FrSky Telemetry Script for OpenTX"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:7
#: eaf6b95f55ba41608c36b5618450b75f
msgid "This is an open source LUA script to display :ref:`FrSky passthrough telemetry <common-frsky-passthrough>` on Horus X10,X12, Jumper T16,T18, Radiomaster TX16S, Taranis X9D,X9E,QX7 and Jumper T12 radios using OpenTX 2.2.3."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:9
#: 9b31f71783e54ad0bc3b4f84563c4592
msgid "This script can be used with FRSky, CRSF, or CRSF using the Passthru  option (:ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 8 enabled when using CRSF)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:11
#: 1be179b4f9d8460dbb6173cca4aacef7
msgid "Support for dual flight batteries is also provided."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:13
#: 83251f89776642b692f34a65dfcce4cc
msgid "Hardware details are shown in  :ref:`FrSky passthrough telemetry <common-frsky-passthrough>` also."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:16
#: 15fcd62680c046f289a0cc6fdee364de
msgid "Display on Horus, Jumper T16/T18 and Radiomaster TX16S"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:21
#: 695cd72018ad4c2ebf678be2f331ac8b
msgid "Display on Taranis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:26
#: 9da9709c51254b8e9863d99e1e6c0789
msgid "Display on QX7 and Jumper T12"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:32
#: ca71e808f0214fe6a7ae2d233f1a02af
msgid "Details can be found `here <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/an-open-source-frsky-telemetry-script-for-the-horus-x10-x12-and-taranis-x9d-x9e-and-qx7-radios/26443>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:34
#: da65e483da9342909d9ec728c42572aa
msgid "Latest script releases are `here <https://github.com/yaapu/FrskyTelemetryScript/releases>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:36
#: 7e2dce2aa84c42f196f1e3c234fd634a
msgid "The script is also compatible with the excellent `MavlinkToPassthru converter firmware <https://github.com/zs6buj/MavlinkToPassthru>`__ by Eric Stockenstrom which allows alternative telemetry transport methods, such as the data modem in DragonlinkRC RC systems, to feed MAVLink data into these transmitters for display by this LUA script."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:38
#: 60c7fb5ee1ab42c6bc49a09d6c6ed952
msgid "Requires `OpenTX 2.2.x <http://www.open-tx.org/>`__ (2.2.3 recommended) and a recent release of ArduPilot with support for :ref:`common-frsky-passthrough`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:41
#: fb5f4c3ff9ed4b94b7a924f76a515e42
msgid "Installation and Operation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:43
#: 762e972295a145a3ae88431882b7cd92
msgid "Complete instructions are provided in the wiki pages `here <https://github.com/yaapu/FrskyTelemetryScript/wiki>`_ , but the general steps are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:45
#: 5947bed1a03244dc96632b43ad183f00
msgid "Copy the SD card directory contents provided in the code section of that github site to your TX's SD card: Horus SD for Horus, T16, and T16s style TXs; Taranis SD for all others."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:46
#: 1cf07795af5b495e8eb5cf8b8a98027e
msgid "On the telemetry display setup page of the TX (or telemetry widget for Horus class TXs) choose the appropriate script as the source for the display page. In the case of Taranis class, the ``yaapu7`` script is for the smaller QX7 size displays, and the ``yaapu9`` is for the Taranix 9x size displays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-yaapu.rst:47
#: d48dba397da54ada8f7f6c4263076a61
